# Secrets — always

Do not read, grep, print, or commit `.env`, `.env.*` (except `.env.example`), `credentials.json`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, or cloud credential files.

Do not write real API keys into the repo. Change `.env.example` keys only; the user fills `.env`.

If a secret appears in a tool result, do not echo it. Ask the user to rotate it.

Follow `.claude/skills/secrets-env/SKILL.md`.
